{{- /*
  find_program pattern - Resolve program path for both Intel and Apple Silicon Macs

  NOTE: chezmoi's include/template functions don't support capturing output into
  variables, so this file serves as DOCUMENTATION for the standard pattern.

  STANDARD PATTERN (copy this for each program):
  {{- $brew := or (lookPath "/opt/homebrew/bin/brew") (lookPath "/usr/local/bin/brew") }}
  {{- $gpg := or (lookPath "/opt/homebrew/bin/gpg") (lookPath "/usr/local/bin/gpg") }}

  Then use with conditional:
  {{- if $brew }}
    {{ $brew }} install something
  {{- end }}

  COMMONLY USED PROGRAMS:
  - brew, gpg, sheldon, zoxide, direnv, mise, thefuck, op, jj, yabai, skhd

  WHY THIS PATTERN:
  - /opt/homebrew/bin = Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3) Homebrew location
  - /usr/local/bin = Intel Mac Homebrew location
  - lookPath returns empty string if not found
  - `or` returns first non-empty value

  ALTERNATIVE: Add paths to [data] in .chezmoi.toml.tmpl for frequently used programs
*/ -}}
